-- R1/R3 shape probe: an ASSUME reached from the @export closure is typed
-- NUMBER, not BOOLEAN. yscript's fact model is propositional-only, so
-- `l4 export yscript` refuses rather than silently coerce or drop it.

ASSUME `the applicant's age` IS A NUMBER

@export Whether the applicant is old enough
DECIDE `the applicant is old enough` IS
    `the applicant's age`
